  "text": "## Internal Controls Framework  \n### Three Lines of Defense  \n**Line 1: Business Units**\n- Responsible for their own controls\n- Day-to-day risk management\n- Daily monitoring and escalation  \n**Line 2: Risk & Compliance**\n- Independent risk oversight\n- Compliance testing\n- Control design review\n- Key control monitoring  \n**Line 3: Internal Audit**\n- Independent assurance\n- Annual audit plan (risk-based)\n- Finding identification and follow-up\n- Reports to Board Audit Committee  \n---",
